        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          A finish nailer is the tool that makes trim look professional, but the choice between 15 and 16 gauge, angled and straight, and cordless and pneumatic decides whether it suits your work. This guide explains each one, then ranks seven real finish nailers you can buy on Amazon.
        </p>

